{
  "baseCommit": "c0cab931591f64440798fcf370e246b5f50d9083",
  "scope": "Standalone anonymous route telemetry; exact restoration to approved UI before analytics.",
  "files": {
    "index.html": {
      "beforeSha256": "6f035f752b7e4573f167de51eb4eeba36ffc3fb0f7aa6d9a4aa242ca03db05b5",
      "afterSha256": "cb44a2d65a2fb3eddb21bc11fc3b1fabcd2399d2a101790a8bd0c8c9e7890f75",
      "beforeText": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Quantum Index — a source-aware map of fundamental physics, equations, evidence and open questions.\" />\n  <title>Quantum Index</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\" crossorigin>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./styles.css?v=2c053050733e9418\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-mark\">Q</div>\n      <div>\n        <h1>Quantum Index</h1>\n        <p>Source-aware map of fundamental physics.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-actions\">\n      <button id=\"resetView\" class=\"ghost\">Reset view</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">FUNDAMENTAL PHYSICS ATLAS</p>\n        <h2>Explore the ideas shaping modern physics.</h2>\n        <p class=\"hero-copy\">Move through theories, equations, evidence, historical lineage and open research while keeping the source trail visible.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"stats\" class=\"stats\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <p id=\"filterScope\" class=\"muted\">Search and filters update the Network map, Timeline and Catalog.</p>\n    <section class=\"controls card\" aria-describedby=\"filterScope\">\n      <div class=\"search-wrap\">\n        <label for=\"search\">Search</label>\n        <input id=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Theory, physicist, concept, tag…\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"categoryFilter\">Category</label>\n        <select id=\"categoryFilter\"><option value=\"\">All categories</option></select>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"kindFilter\">Type</label>\n        <select id=\"kindFilter\"><option value=\"\">All types</option></select>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"statusFilter\">Status</label>\n        <select id=\"statusFilter\"><option value=\"\">All statuses</option></select>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <label for=\"eraFilter\">Era</label>\n        <select id=\"eraFilter\"><option value=\"\">All eras</option></select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"coverage-filter\">\n        <label for=\"sourcedOnly\">Provenance</label>\n        <label class=\"switch-row\"><input id=\"sourcedOnly\" type=\"checkbox\" /> sourced entries only</label>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <nav class=\"tabs\" aria-label=\"Views\">\n      <button class=\"tab active\" data-view=\"explore\">Explore</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"map\">Network map</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"timeline\">Timeline</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"lineage\">Thought trees</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"catalog\">Catalog</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"formula\">Formula atlas</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"compare\">Compare</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"problems\">Problems</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"evidence\">Evidence</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"questions\">Research questions</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"learn\">Learning paths</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"workspace\">My research</button>\n      <button class=\"tab\" data-view=\"coverage\">Coverage</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <section id=\"exploreView\" class=\"view active\" aria-label=\"Explore Quantum Index\">\n      <div class=\"explore-intro card\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">START WITH YOUR QUESTION</p>\n        <h3>Choose how you want to explore fundamental physics</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Move from scientific problems to competing approaches, equations, evidence, recent developments, research questions and primary literature.</p>\n        <div id=\"exploreCards\" class=\"explore-grid\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"explore-columns\">\n        <section class=\"card explore-section\">\n          <div class=\"view-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">WHAT'S NEW</p><h3>Recent reviewed developments</h3></div><a class=\"ghost link-button\" href=\"#/timeline?layer=developments\">Full development timeline</a></div>\n          <div id=\"exploreDevelopments\" class=\"explore-recent\"></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"card explore-section\">\n          <div class=\"view-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">OPEN RESEARCH</p><h3>Questions still requiring work</h3></div><a class=\"ghost link-button\" href=\"#/questions?disposition=open\">All open questions</a></div>\n          <div id=\"exploreQuestions\" class=\"explore-recent\"></div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"evidenceControls\" class=\"card evidence-controls\"><label for=\"relationEvidence\">Relationship evidence</label><select id=\"relationEvidence\"><option value=\"\">All relationships</option><option value=\"sourced\">Source-backed relationships</option><option value=\"documented historical influence\">Documented historical influence</option><option value=\"formal mathematical relation\">Formal mathematical relations</option><option value=\"editorial relation\">Editorial associations</option></select><p class=\"muted\">Upstream and downstream show typed connections, not necessarily historical causation. The filter also applies to theory connections and thought trees.</p></section>\n    <section id=\"coverageView\" class=\"view\"><div id=\"coverageContent\" class=\"card comparison-panel\"></div><div id=\"recordTrust\" class=\"card comparison-panel\"></div></section>\n    <section id=\"mapView\" class=\"view\">\n      <div id=\"documentedNavigation\" class=\"card comparison-panel\"></div>\n      <div class=\"map-layout\">\n        <div class=\"card graph-card\">\n          <div class=\"view-head\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"eyebrow\">RELATIONSHIP GRAPH</p>\n              <h3>Ideas as a connected system</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend\" id=\"legend\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <svg id=\"network\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Interactive network of quantum theories\"></svg>\n          <p class=\"hint\">Drag nodes. Scroll to zoom. Select a node for lineage, status, overlaps and related ideas.</p>\n        </div>\n        <aside id=\"detailPanel\" class=\"card detail-panel\" aria-label=\"Selected network idea\"></aside>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"theoryView\" class=\"view theory-view\" aria-label=\"Theory details\">\n      <a id=\"backToView\" class=\"ghost link-button\" href=\"#/map\">← Back to network map</a>\n      <article id=\"theoryDetail\" class=\"card detail-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\"></article>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"timelineView\" class=\"view\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"view-head timeline-head\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">ORIGINS + DEVELOPMENTS</p>\n            <h3>Timeline of fundamental physics</h3>\n            <p id=\"timelineScopeSummary\" class=\"muted\">Theory origins remain historical; later developments keep their own dates.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"timeline-controls\" aria-label=\"Timeline layers\">\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"timelineLayer\">Show</label>\n              <select id=\"timelineLayer\">\n                <option value=\"all\">Origins + developments</option>\n                <option value=\"origins\">Theory/framework origins</option>\n                <option value=\"developments\">Major developments</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label for=\"timelineEventType\">Development type</label>\n              <select id=\"timelineEventType\"><option value=\"\">All development types</option></select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"timeline\" class=\"timeline\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"lineageView\" class=\"view\">\n      <div class=\"lineage-grid\">\n        <div class=\"card tree-selector-card\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">THOUGHT TREES</p>\n          <h3>Major intellectual branches</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Choose a branch. The map uses the catalog's actual typed relationships; it does not invent arrows between adjacent items.</p>\n          <div id=\"thoughtTrees\" class=\"tree-choice-list\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card thought-tree-card\">\n          <div class=\"thought-tree-head\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"eyebrow\">PROGRESSION MAP</p>\n              <h3 id=\"treeGraphTitle\">Thought tree</h3>\n              <p id=\"treeGraphMeta\" class=\"muted\"></p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"tree-zoom-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Progression map zoom\">\n            <button id=\"treeZoomOut\" class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Zoom out progression map\">−</button>\n            <output id=\"treeZoomStatus\" aria-live=\"polite\">100%</output>\n            <button id=\"treeZoomIn\" class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Zoom in progression map\">+</button>\n            <button id=\"treeZoomFit\" class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\">Reset to fit</button>\n          </div>\n          <p id=\"treeZoomHelp\" class=\"hint\">Zoom with + and −, then drag the background or scroll to pan. Focus the map for arrow keys, +/− and 0 to fit. Select a node to inspect it below; Open full details opens its page.</p>\n          <div id=\"treeGraphViewport\" class=\"thought-tree-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable progression map\" aria-describedby=\"treeZoomHelp\"><svg id=\"thoughtTreeGraph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Chronological thought-tree relationship graph\"></svg></div>\n          <p class=\"hint\">Horizontal position is chronological. Rows show primary catalog category. Arrows appear only for relationships explicitly stored in the index.</p>\n          <div class=\"selected-lineage-panel\">\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">SELECTED LINEAGE</p>\n            <h3 id=\"lineageTitle\">Choose a theory</h3>\n            <div id=\"lineageDetail\" class=\"lineage-detail empty\">Select a node to inspect its upstream ideas, downstream progression and overlaps.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"catalogView\" class=\"view\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"view-head\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">INDEX</p>\n            <h3>All catalogued theories</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span id=\"resultCount\" class=\"pill\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"catalog\" class=\"catalog-grid\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"problemsView\" class=\"view\" aria-label=\"Scientific problems\">\n      <div class=\"problem-layout\">\n        <aside class=\"card problem-selector\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">SCIENTIFIC PROBLEMS</p>\n          <h3>Start with the question physics is trying to answer</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Problems organize existing theories, formulas, evidence, developments and research questions without turning the problem itself into a theory.</p>\n          <div id=\"problemList\" class=\"problem-list\"></div>\n        </aside>\n        <article id=\"problemDetail\" class=\"card problem-detail\" tabindex=\"-1\"></article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"evidenceView\" class=\"view\" aria-label=\"Evidence and constraints\">\n      <div class=\"card evidence-panel\">\n        <div class=\"view-head\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">EVIDENCE + CONSTRAINTS</p>\n            <h3>What experiments and observations actually establish</h3>\n            <p class=\"muted\">Each record separates the measured result from the theories or parameter space it constrains—and from conclusions it does not establish.</p>\n          </div>\n          <span id=\"evidenceCount\" class=\"pill\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"question-controls\">\n          <div><label for=\"evidenceSearch\">Search evidence</label><input id=\"evidenceSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Bell, collapse, DESI, LZ…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"evidenceType\">Evidence type</label><select id=\"evidenceType\"><option value=\"\">All evidence types</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"evidenceProblem\">Problem</label><select id=\"evidenceProblem\"><option value=\"\">All Problems</option></select></div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"evidenceGrid\" class=\"evidence-grid\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"questionsView\" class=\"view\" aria-label=\"Research questions\">\n      <div class=\"card question-panel\">\n        <div class=\"view-head\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">RESEARCH QUESTIONS</p>\n            <h3>What is established, conditional, model-specific or still open?</h3>\n            <p class=\"muted\">These records preserve the reviewed 59-question profile audit and add focused problem-level questions as new literature is reviewed. They are research-orientation summaries, not declarations that every prompt is an unsolved problem.</p>\n          </div>\n          <span id=\"questionCount\" class=\"pill\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"question-controls\">\n          <div><label for=\"questionSearch\">Search questions</label><input id=\"questionSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"black holes, decoherence, dark matter…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"questionDisposition\">Disposition</label><select id=\"questionDisposition\"><option value=\"\">All dispositions</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"questionCategory\">Domain</label><select id=\"questionCategory\"><option value=\"\">All domains</option></select></div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"questionGrid\" class=\"question-grid\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"workspaceView\" class=\"view\" aria-label=\"Personal research\"><div id=\"workspaceContent\"></div></section>\n\n    <section id=\"learnView\" class=\"view\" aria-label=\"Guided learning paths\"><div id=\"learningPaths\"></div></section>\n\n    <section id=\"compareView\" class=\"view\" aria-label=\"Compare theories\">\n      <div class=\"card comparison-panel\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">COMPARE APPROACHES</p>\n        <h3>Explore the differences</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Choose two to four entries. Compare their scope, assumptions, results and limitations. A source citation is not a verdict of experimental confirmation.</p>\n        <div id=\"comparisonPresets\" class=\"detail-actions\"></div>\n        <div id=\"compareSelectors\" class=\"comparison-selectors\"></div>\n        <p id=\"comparisonNotice\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n        <div class=\"detail-actions\"><a id=\"comparisonPermalink\" class=\"ghost link-button\" href=\"#/compare\">Permanent comparison link</a><button id=\"clearComparison\" class=\"ghost\" type=\"button\">Clear selection</button></div>\n        <div id=\"comparisonResults\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card comparison-panel\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">CURATED RESEARCH GUIDES</p>\n        <h3>Foundations, information and gravity</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Expanded research profiles with suggested prerequisites. These reading suggestions are not additional historical connections in the graph.</p>\n        <div id=\"profileCollection\" class=\"profile-collection\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div id=\"formulaReturn\" class=\"detail-actions\" hidden></div>\n    <section id=\"formulaView\" class=\"view\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"view-head formula-head\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">EQUATION INDEX</p>\n            <h3>Quantum formula atlas</h3>\n            <p class=\"muted\">Canonical equations, identities, bounds and model Hamiltonians linked back to the theories and sources that use them.</p>\n          </div>\n          <span id=\"formulaCount\" class=\"pill\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"formula-controls\">\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"formulaSearch\">Search formulas</label>\n            <input id=\"formulaSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Schrödinger, entropy, Hall, Hawking…\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"formulaCategory\">Formula category</label>\n            <select id=\"formulaCategory\"><option value=\"\">All formula categories</option></select>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"formulaType\">Formula role</label>\n            <select id=\"formulaType\"><option value=\"\">All formula roles</option></select>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <label for=\"formulaTheory\">Linked theory</label>\n            <select id=\"formulaTheory\"><option value=\"\">All linked theories</option></select>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"formula-controls\"><div><label for=\"formulaReview\">Metadata review</label><select id=\"formulaReview\"><option value=\"\">All review states</option><option value=\"explicit\">Explicitly reviewed</option><option value=\"baseline-audit-v1\">Baseline metadata</option></select></div></div>\n        <div id=\"formulaGrid\" class=\"formula-grid\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <p id=\"analyticsDisclosure\" class=\"muted\">On quantumindex.site, Cloudflare Web Analytics measures site visits, referrers and page performance without analytics cookies. It does not receive your research notes or saved workspace. Hash-based tabs and search terms are not reported as separate pages. <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/about/\">About Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>.</p>\n  </main>\n\n  <template id=\"emptyDetail\">\n    <div class=\"detail-empty\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">SELECT A NODE</p>\n      <h3>Inspect a theory</h3>\n      <p>Open any node to see its core claim, historical position, status, provenance and relationship graph.</p>\n    </div>\n  </template>\n\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      loader: { load: ['[tex]/boldsymbol'] },\n      tex: { packages: { '[+]': ['boldsymbol'] }, inlineMath: [['\\\\(','\\\\)']], displayMath: [['\\\\[','\\\\]']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/d3@7/dist/d3.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./theories.js?v=0131e84d399bac34\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./formulas.js?v=b9e8e28c4450312f\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./formula-audit.js?v=fb958416812e0ba0\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./developments.js?v=ac50182e95d28220\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./questions.js?v=16beba9fed1761b1\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./evidence.js?v=c1a70f71a1151202\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./problems.js?v=eaea3217c4092cac\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./passports.js?v=703c3fb0a9ee99d8\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./profiles.js?v=911f4adc3e123a7d\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./workspace.js?v=de553a16db91ad46\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./sourced-paths.js?v=ca3c8c04c5a9fc65\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./research-navigation.js?v=90ca00fac77c3e12\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./app.js?v=650b38708ca3ce89\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./analytics.js?v=23eb589ce52a3273\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>"
